{
  "title": "Unique Creamy Croatian Fennel Pilaf",
  "description": "This Croatian dish features fennel bulb and nuka-pickle in a creamy, yeasty pilaf, perfect for a weeknight dinner. It is high in protein and can be made with ease.",
  "cuisine": "Croatian",
  "diet": [
    "gluten-free",
